(2151444, 295248, 39427, '<td valign="top">love the composition but the whole pic seems to be a bit fuzzy, out of focus.  Also, it might be my imagination, but I think the frame is tilted, as the house seems to be leaning to the right a tad... could be easily remedied w/ a rotation... nice shot though</td>', 'love the composition but the whole pic seems to be a bit fuzzy, out of focus.  Also, it might be my imagination, but I think the frame is tilted, as the house seems to be leaning to the right a tad... could be easily remedied w/ a rotation... nice shot though', '2006-02-15 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
