(2154034, 295546, 10858, '<td valign="top">Bit busy to figure out what happens here exactly, but this is a moody photo with a great exposure. It''s good in BW, but I am curious how it looked like in colours.</td>', 'Bit busy to figure out what happens here exactly, but this is a moody photo with a great exposure. It''s good in BW, but I am curious how it looked like in colours.', '2006-02-15 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
