(2154288, 295558, 42005, '<td valign="top">The is absolutely exquisite in so very many ways.  The naturalness of the pose, eye angle and expression, the strength and yet frailty of the lady, the simplicity of the colors, the crispness of focus, the textures of the coat, ribbon, background and scarf in contrast to the type of softenss of the face and hands.....I could go on and on.  This is undeniably a ten and should win the blue hands down.</td>', 'The is absolutely exquisite in so very many ways.  The naturalness of the pose, eye angle and expression, the strength and yet frailty of the lady, the simplicity of the colors, the crispness of focus, the textures of the coat, ribbon, background and scarf in contrast to the type of softenss of the face and hands.....I could go on and on.  This is undeniably a ten and should win the blue hands down.', '2006-02-15 15:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
