(2159488, 294772, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great show, I love that you included the fround in the far, this gives height to the photo. Brave to crop this landscape, but works well. The cliber though almost camouflages on the rock.</td>', 'Great show, I love that you included the fround in the far, this gives height to the photo. Brave to crop this landscape, but works well. The cliber though almost camouflages on the rock.', '2006-02-17 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
