(2159491, 295779, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet very strong. You may get some comments referring to this as cliched but the reason some things become a cliche is because they are so strong at conveying a concept or message that they become shorthand for doing so. Doesn''t make them any less effective at doing so. Really nice sharp edges to the silhouette, a good composition and nice colour range in the background.</td>', 'Simple, yet very strong. You may get some comments referring to this as cliched but the reason some things become a cliche is because they are so strong at conveying a concept or message that they become shorthand for doing so. Doesn''t make them any less effective at doing so. Really nice sharp edges to the silhouette, a good composition and nice colour range in the background.', '2006-02-17 16:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159492, 294624, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the lines here, which lead mz eyes zig-zag through the whole image. I do feel the power of this building.</td>', 'I like the lines here, which lead mz eyes zig-zag through the whole image. I do feel the power of this building.', '2006-02-17 16:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159494, 295609, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, where is my mind? I looked at this and my first thought was "oh look, someone''s underwear got frozen out on the washing line!". Then I realised it was a chain with some kind of pennants hanging from it. I don''t think I understand it''s significance to the challenge though I can see how the geezer or vent behind is powerful and the title talks about seeking power. I don''t understand fully but the image is intriguing.</td>', 'Oh dear, where is my mind? I looked at this and my first thought was "oh look, someone''s underwear got frozen out on the washing line!". Then I realised it was a chain with some kind of pennants hanging from it. I don''t think I understand it''s significance to the challenge though I can see how the geezer or vent behind is powerful and the title talks about seeking power. I don''t understand fully but the image is intriguing.', '2006-02-17 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2159559, 295178, 53551, '<td valign="top">I would have used different color beads.  Just kidding.</td>', 'I would have used different color beads.  Just kidding.', '2006-02-17 17:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
