(2160142, 295598, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the color tones/hues along with the texture of the wall.</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the color tones/hues along with the texture of the wall.', '2006-02-17 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160146, 295834, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm..intersting. The white is a bit too bright for me.</td>', 'Hmmm..intersting. The white is a bit too bright for me.', '2006-02-17 22:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160148, 295328, 41675, '<td valign="top">for me, your image would be more powerful if cropped off the top and turned into more of a horizontal. Also, keeping all four candles within the frame rather than having them cut off. I also wonder how this would look in black and white - might help with the grain, unless you''re going for that look.</td>', 'for me, your image would be more powerful if cropped off the top and turned into more of a horizontal. Also, keeping all four candles within the frame rather than having them cut off. I also wonder how this would look in black and white - might help with the grain, unless you''re going for that look.', '2006-02-17 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160151, 295247, 41675, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the overall simplicity and color tones you''ve created that I really like. Terrific use of the shadow as well. Added to my favorites. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There''s something about the overall simplicity and color tones you''ve created that I really like. Terrific use of the shadow as well. Added to my favorites. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-17 22:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160152, 295546, 41675, '<td valign="top">Excellent black and white image. Good contrast and fits the challenge well. Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent black and white image. Good contrast and fits the challenge well. Good luck.', '2006-02-17 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160153, 295742, 41675, '<td valign="top">The flash hot spots and overall grain detract from your image for me. Perhaps if taken from a different angle and not so..."dead" centered would enhance your concept.</td>', 'The flash hot spots and overall grain detract from your image for me. Perhaps if taken from a different angle and not so..."dead" centered would enhance your concept.', '2006-02-17 22:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160154, 293895, 42984, '<td valign="top">For me this struggles illustrate the point made by the caption. Perhaps it''s the crop which has left too much of the neutral sky/land on the riht hand side. I can see what you were trying to achieve ad I think focussing on the light out of the sky and the insignificant land beneath might just do it.</td>', 'For me this struggles illustrate the point made by the caption. Perhaps it''s the crop which has left too much of the neutral sky/land on the riht hand side. I can see what you were trying to achieve ad I think focussing on the light out of the sky and the insignificant land beneath might just do it.', '2006-02-17 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160155, 295701, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape and composition. I like the red roof.</td>', 'Nice landscape and composition. I like the red roof.', '2006-02-17 22:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160159, 293844, 42984, '<td valign="top">This si the sort of photo I wish I could take. Ever since Mother challeng I''ve been wanting this effect but I really didn''t think I could get it right so I chickened out and didn''t try.</td>', 'This si the sort of photo I wish I could take. Ever since Mother challeng I''ve been wanting this effect but I really didn''t think I could get it right so I chickened out and didn''t try.', '2006-02-17 22:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160160, 295367, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had the people in the background been blurred out a bit, this would place the focus more on the homeless man, at least in my opinion. I like the use of black and white and good contrast.</td>', 'Had the people in the background been blurred out a bit, this would place the focus more on the homeless man, at least in my opinion. I like the use of black and white and good contrast.', '2006-02-17 22:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160161, 295291, 41675, '<td valign="top">One of the better "Faith" entries I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Nice depth of field and good composition. If the black shadow in the upper left had been cropped out I would have scored this even higher. 8</td>', 'One of the better "Faith" entries I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Nice depth of field and good composition. If the black shadow in the upper left had been cropped out I would have scored this even higher. 8', '2006-02-17 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160166, 295512, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image and entry for fortitude. Maybe a bit too much negative space on the left, but still a good photo.</td>', 'Nice image and entry for fortitude. Maybe a bit too much negative space on the left, but still a good photo.', '2006-02-17 22:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160168, 293215, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had it not been for the person walking in the background this would have been an even more powerful image. Good use of black and white and great contrast.</td>', 'Had it not been for the person walking in the background this would have been an even more powerful image. Good use of black and white and great contrast.', '2006-02-17 22:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160169, 294357, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s me or my monitor, but the birds look oddly...beveled. Maybe it''s due to the overall softness. I like the color tones you chose.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s me or my monitor, but the birds look oddly...beveled. Maybe it''s due to the overall softness. I like the color tones you chose.', '2006-02-17 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160171, 295920, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee. Point for humor. Good use of black and white and nicely lit. For me, I would have preferred seeing the entire "E" in EOS, but that''s being picky.</td>', 'Tee hee. Point for humor. Good use of black and white and nicely lit. For me, I would have preferred seeing the entire "E" in EOS, but that''s being picky.', '2006-02-17 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160175, 295142, 41675, '<td valign="top">While I don''t personally find your subject matter holds my attention that well, I do like the lighting and matching color tones.</td>', 'While I don''t personally find your subject matter holds my attention that well, I do like the lighting and matching color tones.', '2006-02-17 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160292, 295701, 30982, '<td valign="top">The "house" almost seems out of place against the massive mesa-like structure.  Has a serene feel to it.</td>', 'The "house" almost seems out of place against the massive mesa-like structure.  Has a serene feel to it.', '2006-02-18 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160293, 295165, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somehow I''m betting the cards are glued together... :-)  Nice use of "spot" lighting.</td>', 'Somehow I''m betting the cards are glued together... :-)  Nice use of "spot" lighting.', '2006-02-18 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160296, 294624, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits one of the virtues.  The lines are very interesting, but I can''t help but feel it''s all about to tip over!</td>', 'Not sure how this fits one of the virtues.  The lines are very interesting, but I can''t help but feel it''s all about to tip over!', '2006-02-18 00:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160298, 295794, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the use of DOF - would prefer just a bit more light.</td>', 'I like the use of DOF - would prefer just a bit more light.', '2006-02-18 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160300, 295920, 32033, '<td valign="top">Notwith that tamron ... you need a canon.  I like the image, good shot</td>', 'Notwith that tamron ... you need a canon.  I like the image, good shot', '2006-02-18 00:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160301, 295834, 30982, '<td valign="top">Justice is peeking.  Has a three dimensional feel to it.</td>', 'Justice is peeking.  Has a three dimensional feel to it.', '2006-02-18 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160304, 293627, 30982, '<td valign="top">The DOF used leaves a very small area in focus - a bit more in focus, particularly part of the eyebrow, might be more pleasing.</td>', 'The DOF used leaves a very small area in focus - a bit more in focus, particularly part of the eyebrow, might be more pleasing.', '2006-02-18 00:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160315, 295183, 42013, '<td valign="top">Simon Peter eh?</td>', 'Simon Peter eh?', '2006-02-18 00:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160337, 295219, 41574, '<td valign="top">An OK snapshot of a bible.</td>', 'An OK snapshot of a bible.', '2006-02-18 00:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160338, 293851, 41574, '<td valign="top">It''s a picture of a dog...that''s it. At that, the colors are dull, and the shot is simply "average." Sorry if this sounds harsh.</td>', 'It''s a picture of a dog...that''s it. At that, the colors are dull, and the shot is simply "average." Sorry if this sounds harsh.', '2006-02-18 00:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160491, 295165, 33025, '<td valign="top">Awesome image... how''d you do it?<br/>I like the paralleling of the parquet floor and the triangular structure of the cards, very nice.</td>', 'Awesome image... how''d you do it?I like the paralleling of the parquet floor and the triangular structure of the cards, very nice.', '2006-02-18 02:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160515, 295247, 48545, '<td valign="top">lovely image, the grain effect works welll.  The crop seems a little tight on the spoon, but a great idea and photo all the same.</td>', 'lovely image, the grain effect works welll.  The crop seems a little tight on the spoon, but a great idea and photo all the same.', '2006-02-18 02:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160517, 295100, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and photo, personally I''d like to see this a bit sharper, nice leading lines though.</td>', 'Nice idea and photo, personally I''d like to see this a bit sharper, nice leading lines though.', '2006-02-18 02:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160518, 295291, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice image, sharpness and composition, the rosemary beads(?) add a nice touch of colour to the photo.</td>', 'Nice image, sharpness and composition, the rosemary beads(?) add a nice touch of colour to the photo.', '2006-02-18 02:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160520, 293844, 48545, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and clarity.  A nice calming effect has been achieved by this photo.  If I was being really picky, I''d say that a couple of stray hairs are a  little distracting.</td>', 'Great lighting, and clarity.  A nice calming effect has been achieved by this photo.  If I was being really picky, I''d say that a couple of stray hairs are a  little distracting.', '2006-02-18 02:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160521, 295607, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, if the bike was moving to the left, composition might have been better if there was space to the left, not the right.  The photo doesn''t come across balanced to me.</td>', 'Nice photo, if the bike was moving to the left, composition might have been better if there was space to the left, not the right.  The photo doesn''t come across balanced to me.', '2006-02-18 02:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160523, 294580, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and colours.  There are strong entry and exit points to the photo.</td>', 'Nice lines and colours.  There are strong entry and exit points to the photo.', '2006-02-18 02:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160525, 295859, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea to include the sigh on the right to the photo, but the photo seems to be a little bit underexposed.</td>', 'Good idea to include the sigh on the right to the photo, but the photo seems to be a little bit underexposed.', '2006-02-18 02:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160526, 295512, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the triangle shadow on the left is a little bit distracting.</td>', 'Good composition, but the triangle shadow on the left is a little bit distracting.', '2006-02-18 02:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160527, 295600, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is good as composition and idea, seems a little bit busy, anyway, and without the title, it''s not immediately appearant that it''s about faith.</td>', 'This is good as composition and idea, seems a little bit busy, anyway, and without the title, it''s not immediately appearant that it''s about faith.', '2006-02-18 02:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160528, 294775, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, but a bit underexposed (see the trunk of the tree), and the colours are unnatural.</td>', 'Good DOF, but a bit underexposed (see the trunk of the tree), and the colours are unnatural.', '2006-02-18 02:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160530, 295697, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good composition, though the too much snow makes it feel like overexposed a bit. Alltogether I like the scene.</td>', 'Good composition, though the too much snow makes it feel like overexposed a bit. Alltogether I like the scene.', '2006-02-18 02:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160584, 295529, 10858, '<td valign="top">The sky is scary. Maybe it would be better to crop the big back silhouette tomb on the left, not sure.</td>', 'The sky is scary. Maybe it would be better to crop the big back silhouette tomb on the left, not sure.', '2006-02-18 04:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160600, 295858, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting of the soldier statue in the front.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting of the soldier statue in the front.', '2006-02-18 04:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160602, 293929, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the lines leading my eyes to the cross, the sky is a thankful background here.</td>', 'I like the lines leading my eyes to the cross, the sky is a thankful background here.', '2006-02-18 05:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160604, 295126, 10858, '<td valign="top">A touching photo of a human fate, BW was a good choice. The dog watching is a nice element. I would also try this photo moving a bit to the right, and choosing a lower angle, which would show the artist more from the front and the dog from the profile.</td>', 'A touching photo of a human fate, BW was a good choice. The dog watching is a nice element. I would also try this photo moving a bit to the right, and choosing a lower angle, which would show the artist more from the front and the dog from the profile.', '2006-02-18 05:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160606, 295100, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject, I love it! Maybe focus is too soft, personally I think a stronger focus would work better here.</td>', 'Great composition and subject, I love it! Maybe focus is too soft, personally I think a stronger focus would work better here.', '2006-02-18 05:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160607, 295021, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition and viewpont which shows Her full of mercy. i also like he background fading to dark.</td>', 'Great composition and viewpont which shows Her full of mercy. i also like he background fading to dark.', '2006-02-18 05:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160610, 294357, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I like the wy they fill the photo. Maybe a bit oversharpened, not sure.</td>', 'Great capture, I like the wy they fill the photo. Maybe a bit oversharpened, not sure.', '2006-02-18 05:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160611, 295367, 10858, '<td valign="top">The fence adds an emotive plus to this shot, which eliminates the main character. This makes him more lonely and rueable.</td>', 'The fence adds an emotive plus to this shot, which eliminates the main character. This makes him more lonely and rueable.', '2006-02-18 05:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160612, 295609, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good composition to have the ice and the hot water column on the same photo, and the ice leads my eyes to the steaming water. Personally I think it would be even more better without the orange stuff in the ice.</td>', 'Good composition to have the ice and the hot water column on the same photo, and the ice leads my eyes to the steaming water. Personally I think it would be even more better without the orange stuff in the ice.', '2006-02-18 05:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160614, 295165, 10858, '<td valign="top">What a patience and persistence your model has! Great capture!</td>', 'What a patience and persistence your model has! Great capture!', '2006-02-18 05:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160616, 295865, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Good lighting and composition.', '2006-02-18 05:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160617, 294655, 10858, '<td valign="top">Light in the darkness truly represents the feeling of hope. It would be even better if the rocks in the front would be darker, it would not then compete with the distant light pulling me.</td>', 'Light in the darkness truly represents the feeling of hope. It would be even better if the rocks in the front would be darker, it would not then compete with the distant light pulling me.', '2006-02-18 05:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160618, 293844, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, it''s a nice soft portrait. Not immediately appearent that it''s the Bible that she is reading, but I like this one.</td>', 'Great lighting, it''s a nice soft portrait. Not immediately appearent that it''s the Bible that she is reading, but I like this one.', '2006-02-18 05:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160621, 295900, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting here. For me it''s rather showing hopeless, maybe if there was a little-little more lighting on the fingers, it would be more appearent that your model is praying. I would also vut the bottom, to make the knee(?) out of sight).</td>', 'I love the lighting here. For me it''s rather showing hopeless, maybe if there was a little-little more lighting on the fingers, it would be more appearent that your model is praying. I would also vut the bottom, to make the knee(?) out of sight).', '2006-02-18 05:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160623, 294024, 10858, '<td valign="top">DOF is great here! I like the snow on Her, because it''s like She is having a couat, and the church entry in the background was a good idea, to include.</td>', 'DOF is great here! I like the snow on Her, because it''s like She is having a couat, and the church entry in the background was a good idea, to include.', '2006-02-18 05:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160625, 295519, 10858, '<td valign="top">Sweet!!! Without the title I would not associate to these virtues, but I like the photo.</td>', 'Sweet!!! Without the title I would not associate to these virtues, but I like the photo.', '2006-02-18 05:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160627, 295544, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, colours and perspective, would fit virtues and sins as well, because of the temptation. This was my first thought, too, before I read the title.</td>', 'Great lighting, colours and perspective, would fit virtues and sins as well, because of the temptation. This was my first thought, too, before I read the title.', '2006-02-18 05:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160629, 295612, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good framing with the door, though, the side could be more vertical, the distortion may be because of the wide angle lens and the viewpoint you choose. The altar could be more in focus IMO.</td>', 'Good framing with the door, though, the side could be more vertical, the distortion may be because of the wide angle lens and the viewpoint you choose. The altar could be more in focus IMO.', '2006-02-18 05:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160630, 295616, 10858, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, whih I like, but another perspective, which shows more of the feet (from the side or above, the whole feet) would be better IMO.</td>', 'Unique idea, whih I like, but another perspective, which shows more of the feet (from the side or above, the whole feet) would be better IMO.', '2006-02-18 05:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160631, 295738, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset, but it''s tilting to the right. I have the feeling that water will be spilt out of the photo. I would include more to the left and crop on the right, I would also crop on the bottom and maybe include more on the top. The rule of thirds would enhance this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset, but it''s tilting to the right. I have the feeling that water will be spilt out of the photo. I would include more to the left and crop on the right, I would also crop on the bottom and maybe include more on the top. The rule of thirds would enhance this photo.', '2006-02-18 05:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160632, 294087, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a heavenly beautiful face! Could be more in focus, and I feel like the photo is underexposed, it needs more lightig.</td>', 'Nice composition and a heavenly beautiful face! Could be more in focus, and I feel like the photo is underexposed, it needs more lightig.', '2006-02-18 05:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160633, 295540, 10858, '<td valign="top">BW works well here, I like the lighting and the texture of the hand.</td>', 'BW works well here, I like the lighting and the texture of the hand.', '2006-02-18 05:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160634, 294109, 10858, '<td valign="top">The sun is a bit bright, but I like you recogniyed the bird reaching up to it! Square crop works well here.</td>', 'The sun is a bit bright, but I like you recogniyed the bird reaching up to it! Square crop works well here.', '2006-02-18 05:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160640, 294371, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, I also like the costume. It would be even better if the mask would cover the dark eyebrow.</td>', 'Great lighting, I also like the costume. It would be even better if the mask would cover the dark eyebrow.', '2006-02-18 05:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160641, 295456, 10858, '<td valign="top">I lik ethe composition here, BW and the pink clothes of the girl work well together, nice selective desaturation.</td>', 'I lik ethe composition here, BW and the pink clothes of the girl work well together, nice selective desaturation.', '2006-02-18 06:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160642, 294388, 10858, '<td valign="top">Cool frog! :-) I like the composition, the blue background works well with the green frog.</td>', 'Cool frog! :-) I like the composition, the blue background works well with the green frog.', '2006-02-18 06:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160643, 294408, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very moody photo, the dark tones are scary, but the light breaking out fills me with hope. If this was the purpose, it''s very well done.</td>', 'Very moody photo, the dark tones are scary, but the light breaking out fills me with hope. If this was the purpose, it''s very well done.', '2006-02-18 06:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160646, 293851, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the expression on the dog''s face. It''s great that dry grass is surrounding him (her?), gives a nice mood to the photo. Not sure though about the WB.</td>', 'I like the composition and the expression on the dog''s face. It''s great that dry grass is surrounding him (her?), gives a nice mood to the photo. Not sure though about the WB.', '2006-02-18 06:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160650, 295185, 10858, '<td valign="top">Stunning expressions on the faces! It would be even better without the jacket(?) in the left bottom corner, but alltogether a great emotive capture!</td>', 'Stunning expressions on the faces! It would be even better without the jacket(?) in the left bottom corner, but alltogether a great emotive capture!', '2006-02-18 06:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160653, 295291, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, though I would prefer less magenta on the paper and the cross could be entirely in focus.</td>', 'Nice composition, though I would prefer less magenta on the paper and the cross could be entirely in focus.', '2006-02-18 06:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160654, 293627, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but I would like it more if the eyelashes would be all in focus.</td>', 'Nice capture, but I would like it more if the eyelashes would be all in focus.', '2006-02-18 06:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160656, 295665, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, but I would prefer it if the moon was not that overexposed.</td>', 'Nice night shot, but I would prefer it if the moon was not that overexposed.', '2006-02-18 06:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160658, 293289, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The church is tilting a bit to the left, but I think the exposure is good. Why didn''t you upload it bigger? I would also remove the big border, a thinner one would fit better.</td>', 'Nice composition. The church is tilting a bit to the left, but I think the exposure is good. Why didn''t you upload it bigger? I would also remove the big border, a thinner one would fit better.', '2006-02-18 06:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160660, 295901, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, and the emptyness of the cemetary with the only human who is the main character.</td>', 'I like the composition here, and the emptyness of the cemetary with the only human who is the main character.', '2006-02-18 06:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160661, 295328, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I also lik ethe grain which rarely works well. The candles are very much overexposed though.</td>', 'Great composition, I also lik ethe grain which rarely works well. The candles are very much overexposed though.', '2006-02-18 06:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160664, 294289, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good composition and exposure, though I miss the wow factor which would ma e it a stunning one.</td>', 'Good composition and exposure, though I miss the wow factor which would ma e it a stunning one.', '2006-02-18 06:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
