(2160718, 294371, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good, crisp clean background and well focused image. The "curtain-like" tie around the waist seems a bit large for her, but thats just me. 9</td>', 'Nicely done. Good, crisp clean background and well focused image. The "curtain-like" tie around the waist seems a bit large for her, but thats just me. 9', '2006-02-18 08:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160719, 295126, 27460, '<td valign="top">this image has a lot of potential, but i think the composition could be improved a little. the problem is that its hard to focus on what is actually going on in the picture. the best aspect is the little dog watching this man, which draws away from what i believe was your main focus. perhaps if the piece of paper on the right was removed and you had a little better lighting so as not to lose all of the detail in his hair it would be a better shot. also, using the leading lines of the wall on more of an angle would better emphasize the man in the shot. hth.</td>', 'this image has a lot of potential, but i think the composition could be improved a little. the problem is that its hard to focus on what is actually going on in the picture. the best aspect is the little dog watching this man, which draws away from what i believe was your main focus. perhaps if the piece of paper on the right was removed and you had a little better lighting so as not to lose all of the detail in his hair it would be a better shot. also, using the leading lines of the wall on more of an angle would better emphasize the man in the shot. hth.', '2006-02-18 08:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160721, 294818, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the many tree branches make this a busy photograph, and my eyes jump all over the place looking for one focal point, but find none. Interesting treatment choice on the sky, I didn''t like it much when I first saw your image, but it''s grown on me the longer I look at it.</td>', 'For me, the many tree branches make this a busy photograph, and my eyes jump all over the place looking for one focal point, but find none. Interesting treatment choice on the sky, I didn''t like it much when I first saw your image, but it''s grown on me the longer I look at it.', '2006-02-18 08:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160722, 295776, 27460, '<td valign="top">branches in background are a bit distracting against the white wall. also the dead planters on the sides are a bit distracting. i think the angle is a bit off here too, i''d either overly emphasize the angle (from bottom looking up OR the left-right slant, but not both at the same time).<br/>also a tighter crop would help bring this image to life a bit more.</td>', 'branches in background are a bit distracting against the white wall. also the dead planters on the sides are a bit distracting. i think the angle is a bit off here too, i''d either overly emphasize the angle (from bottom looking up OR the left-right slant, but not both at the same time).also a tighter crop would help bring this image to life a bit more.', '2006-02-18 08:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160724, 295183, 27460, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure how your image actually conveys the title. the subject looks more like he''s lost than he has faith. perhaps he''s doing tai chi? if so, it may have been better to wait for a better/more distinguishable pose? its a nice shot, i''m just confused as to the relation to the title.</td>', 'i''m not sure how your image actually conveys the title. the subject looks more like he''s lost than he has faith. perhaps he''s doing tai chi? if so, it may have been better to wait for a better/more distinguishable pose? its a nice shot, i''m just confused as to the relation to the title.', '2006-02-18 08:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160728, 295578, 27460, '<td valign="top">lighting is unbalanced (her hair and her lower cheek are burning out), background of the bedpost is distracting. crop on the right-hand side is a bit odd, as it seems she is floating, perhaps crop a little into and use her body as a frame.<br/>for a better effect, i would have taken this picture at night time to give the idea that she is saying her prayers BEFORE waking up which is more customary than after you wake up.</td>', 'lighting is unbalanced (her hair and her lower cheek are burning out), background of the bedpost is distracting. crop on the right-hand side is a bit odd, as it seems she is floating, perhaps crop a little into and use her body as a frame.for a better effect, i would have taken this picture at night time to give the idea that she is saying her prayers BEFORE waking up which is more customary than after you wake up.', '2006-02-18 08:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160729, 293627, 27460, '<td valign="top">i''m not overly sure i like the centered-balance of this shot. its a nice shot of an eye, just not sure of the balance/position.</td>', 'i''m not overly sure i like the centered-balance of this shot. its a nice shot of an eye, just not sure of the balance/position.', '2006-02-18 08:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160730, 293929, 27460, '<td valign="top">interesting use of leading lines, wish the corss was a bit sharper, or even had more of a glowing effect to it.</td>', 'interesting use of leading lines, wish the corss was a bit sharper, or even had more of a glowing effect to it.', '2006-02-18 08:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160731, 295900, 27460, '<td valign="top">difficult to distinguish subject matter. i like the smoke and silhouette, but i find it loses alot of meaning without compromising its art appeal. a nice shot artistically.</td>', 'difficult to distinguish subject matter. i like the smoke and silhouette, but i find it loses alot of meaning without compromising its art appeal. a nice shot artistically.', '2006-02-18 08:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160739, 295032, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cute baby! The color treatment, for me at least, seems a bit overly done, especially on the baby''s arm. I like the eyes.</td>', 'Cute baby! The color treatment, for me at least, seems a bit overly done, especially on the baby''s arm. I like the eyes.', '2006-02-18 08:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160740, 295905, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, i your image had been more in focus, I would have scored it better.</td>', 'For me, i your image had been more in focus, I would have scored it better.', '2006-02-18 08:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160742, 295697, 41675, '<td valign="top">Mighty long title to explain your image, but I''m not holding it for or against you. Nice black and white landscape, good composition.</td>', 'Mighty long title to explain your image, but I''m not holding it for or against you. Nice black and white landscape, good composition.', '2006-02-18 08:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160743, 295858, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve taken a really good image of statues - the foreground one looks almost real. I wonder how this would look if you cropped our the statue on the right. I find the two on the left hold my interest so much more. Well done.</td>', 'I think you''ve taken a really good image of statues - the foreground one looks almost real. I wonder how this would look if you cropped our the statue on the right. I find the two on the left hold my interest so much more. Well done.', '2006-02-18 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160748, 292998, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting. My mind keeps trying to tie the smoke with faith. Is your faith burning? - or I''m simply trying to read to much into it and you added smoke for additional interest. :-) Had the bookmark or the word faith itself been a bit sharper, I would have scored this higher.</td>', 'Interesting. My mind keeps trying to tie the smoke with faith. Is your faith burning? - or I''m simply trying to read to much into it and you added smoke for additional interest. :-) Had the bookmark or the word faith itself been a bit sharper, I would have scored this higher.', '2006-02-18 08:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160752, 293895, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish your image were larger and that there was a bit more light in the foreground. My favorite part is the light in the clouds. Looks like it was quite some storm.</td>', 'For me, I wish your image were larger and that there was a bit more light in the foreground. My favorite part is the light in the clouds. Looks like it was quite some storm.', '2006-02-18 08:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160754, 295314, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - funny candid shot. The background makes this look more like a snapshot, but the models look like they had fun.</td>', 'LOL - funny candid shot. The background makes this look more like a snapshot, but the models look like they had fun.', '2006-02-18 08:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
