(2160761, 295100, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the man''s face, and the color values you chose. The one thing I find distracting is the...rock(?) in the foreground against the other man''s back. Looks odd, but that''s just me. Otherwise, a good image.</td>', 'I like the expression on the man''s face, and the color values you chose. The one thing I find distracting is the...rock(?) in the foreground against the other man''s back. Looks odd, but that''s just me. Otherwise, a good image.', '2006-02-18 08:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160762, 294081, 41675, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I''m kind of at a loss on how to score this. On one hand, I like the overall softness, but on the other hand I wonder if it would be a stronger image without the soft haze/screen. Sorry, I''m not a very technical person. I like the idea, but for me, I think it would work better with more saturation.</td>', 'To be honest, I''m kind of at a loss on how to score this. On one hand, I like the overall softness, but on the other hand I wonder if it would be a stronger image without the soft haze/screen. Sorry, I''m not a very technical person. I like the idea, but for me, I think it would work better with more saturation.', '2006-02-18 08:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160764, 295794, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good entry for the challenge. The blacks and shadows are a bit too dark for my personal tastes, but overall I like it. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good entry for the challenge. The blacks and shadows are a bit too dark for my personal tastes, but overall I like it. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-02-18 08:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160765, 294978, 41675, '<td valign="top">Are those dolls? :-) Made me chuckle. It also appears there is some kind of text in the lower left? The sky is a bit on the green side, but your idea fits the challenge.</td>', 'Are those dolls? :-) Made me chuckle. It also appears there is some kind of text in the lower left? The sky is a bit on the green side, but your idea fits the challenge.', '2006-02-18 08:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160768, 294087, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, shows creativity and imagination. I''m not sure how you did the "halo", but my perception makes me think she is about to get hit in the head with that darker green circle object. I think with a stronger light source and more focus, this could be a really great image.</td>', 'I like your concept, shows creativity and imagination. I''m not sure how you did the "halo", but my perception makes me think she is about to get hit in the head with that darker green circle object. I think with a stronger light source and more focus, this could be a really great image.', '2006-02-18 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160769, 295189, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve given this a lower score due to the very red skin tones, the small size of the image and it looks like a quick phone cam shot. If the guy in the middle had been looking at the camera and the girl''s face not cut off, I would have scored this a point higher.</td>', 'I''ve given this a lower score due to the very red skin tones, the small size of the image and it looks like a quick phone cam shot. If the guy in the middle had been looking at the camera and the girl''s face not cut off, I would have scored this a point higher.', '2006-02-18 08:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160771, 295913, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a nice photo of a church, but doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge. The colors of the bricks themselves look odd to me, too dark, but that''s just me.</td>', 'For me, this is a nice photo of a church, but doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge. The colors of the bricks themselves look odd to me, too dark, but that''s just me.', '2006-02-18 09:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160772, 295755, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this would be a much more powerful image had the girl on the right been cropped out. The other four have such serious, haunting expressions, yet she is smiling and offering a peace sign. I love the tones of your image.</td>', 'For me, this would be a much more powerful image had the girl on the right been cropped out. The other four have such serious, haunting expressions, yet she is smiling and offering a peace sign. I love the tones of your image.', '2006-02-18 09:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160774, 295738, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice sunrise/seascape. Since the boat and sun on the water are vertical elements, I''d be curious to see how this would look if cropped in more from the right side making the photo more of a vertical image. This would also off-center the boat and perhaps make it more interesting. Just my novice opinion. Very nice sky colors.</td>', 'Nice sunrise/seascape. Since the boat and sun on the water are vertical elements, I''d be curious to see how this would look if cropped in more from the right side making the photo more of a vertical image. This would also off-center the boat and perhaps make it more interesting. Just my novice opinion. Very nice sky colors.', '2006-02-18 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160775, 295185, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I think this image would be even more powerful if it were cropped in from the left side - to eliminate the woman in the background. With the expressions you captured on the women''s faces, I can feel their pain and anguish. Nicely done.</td>', 'For me, I think this image would be even more powerful if it were cropped in from the left side - to eliminate the woman in the background. With the expressions you captured on the women''s faces, I can feel their pain and anguish. Nicely done.', '2006-02-18 09:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160777, 294617, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of your image. The stark blue sky agains the white church and the red roof. Good lighting and I even like the angle.</td>', 'I like the colors of your image. The stark blue sky agains the white church and the red roof. Good lighting and I even like the angle.', '2006-02-18 09:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2160778, 295038, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....while I like the angle, I''m tyring to figure out which virtue this is. Faith? because it''s a church? I find the fan the least interesting part of your photo, but I really like the upper half of your image - that holds my interest.</td>', 'Hmmm....while I like the angle, I''m tyring to figure out which virtue this is. Faith? because it''s a church? I find the fan the least interesting part of your photo, but I really like the upper half of your image - that holds my interest.', '2006-02-18 09:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
