(2161920, 292998, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to incorporate the challenge into a smoke picture.  The tip of the incense (?) might be better off not in the shot.</td>', 'Interesting way to incorporate the challenge into a smoke picture.  The tip of the incense (?) might be better off not in the shot.', '2006-02-18 19:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
