(2163634, 294658, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh my this is a ugly picture.  Why the focus on the teeth and complexion?  Maybe better in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Oh my this is a ugly picture.  Why the focus on the teeth and complexion?  Maybe better in B&W?', '2006-02-19 16:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163635, 295905, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s painfully out of focuse.  Would''ve been nice if it was in focus.</td>', 'Oh, that''s painfully out of focuse.  Would''ve been nice if it was in focus.', '2006-02-19 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163639, 295756, 40580, '<td valign="top">I first voted this a 3, but when I came to comment on it (I always come back and comment) I realized it''s a great shot.  I don''t know what I was thinking.  Maybe it is her teeth or her glasses.<br/> <br/>For some reason, their eyes are peircing.  Good shot.  I''d remove her glasses next time.</td>', 'I first voted this a 3, but when I came to comment on it (I always come back and comment) I realized it''s a great shot.  I don''t know what I was thinking.  Maybe it is her teeth or her glasses. For some reason, their eyes are peircing.  Good shot.  I''d remove her glasses next time.', '2006-02-19 16:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2163641, 295185, 40580, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the subject.  Lighting''s a little harsh and the background is distracting.  Try better next time.</td>', 'I don''t understand the subject.  Lighting''s a little harsh and the background is distracting.  Try better next time.', '2006-02-19 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
