(2167294, 295755, 49720, '<td valign="top">Here I see the opposite faces of life: it must be strong to survive if you are unlucky, but your soul never stops to be happy for life. The high intensity of the eye-catching, the mother instinct of the sister protecting the brother and the happiness of the smile, all they produce a picture full of life.</td>', 'Here I see the opposite faces of life: it must be strong to survive if you are unlucky, but your soul never stops to be happy for life. The high intensity of the eye-catching, the mother instinct of the sister protecting the brother and the happiness of the smile, all they produce a picture full of life.', '2006-02-21 05:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
