(2168862, 294772, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great sense of scale here to go along with the topic.  I know that you want the rock wall to be vertical, but I can''t help but feel like that water level needs a bit of a tweak to make it flat.  A fantastic capture for the challenge!</td>', 'Great sense of scale here to go along with the topic.  I know that you want the rock wall to be vertical, but I can''t help but feel like that water level needs a bit of a tweak to make it flat.  A fantastic capture for the challenge!', '2006-02-21 19:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
