(2170483, 294081, 51759, '<td valign="top">My aim was to focus on the element of patience found in temperance; it has been argued that they go hand in hand. The blurriness is most likely caused by moving the camera - macro lenses can be tricky that way. Thanks for the comments, and I hope you''ll all forgive my _horrid_ typo (no sarcasm).</td>', 'My aim was to focus on the element of patience found in temperance; it has been argued that they go hand in hand. The blurriness is most likely caused by moving the camera - macro lenses can be tricky that way. Thanks for the comments, and I hope you''ll all forgive my _horrid_ typo (no sarcasm).', '2006-02-22 07:44:47.000000', NULL, 0),
