(2174289, 295165, 28710, '<td valign="top">It''s true that you have a great illusion here and it''s done very well, and your lighting totally rocks, but for me the star of the show is the model.<br/> <br/>There is something about him that really speaks a type of faith that is very "Matrix children". He''s got a kind of relaxed stance as he sits there in sock feet with a typical retro, 70''s/early 80''s style haircut that speaks of being totally unconcerned, be it with physics or anything else.<br/> <br/>Great capture.</td>', 'It''s true that you have a great illusion here and it''s done very well, and your lighting totally rocks, but for me the star of the show is the model. There is something about him that really speaks a type of faith that is very "Matrix children". He''s got a kind of relaxed stance as he sits there in sock feet with a typical retro, 70''s/early 80''s style haircut that speaks of being totally unconcerned, be it with physics or anything else. Great capture.', '2006-02-22 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2174803, 294517, 49858, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge comments:<br/> <br/>Wow, 8th!!!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone that voted.<br/> <br/>I was quite confident that this picture would do well, but I had no idea that I would get a top 10 finish!<br/> <br/>I rather liked the vapour trail in the sky, as it adds a contrast - who is in the heavens, the living or the dead?  However I can also see, that form some peoples point of view that the vapour trail slightly distracts from the main picture.<br/> <br/>Nigel</td>', 'Post Challenge comments: Wow, 8th!!! Thanks to everyone that voted. I was quite confident that this picture would do well, but I had no idea that I would get a top 10 finish! I rather liked the vapour trail in the sky, as it adds a contrast - who is in the heavens, the living or the dead?  However I can also see, that form some peoples point of view that the vapour trail slightly distracts from the main picture. Nigel', '2006-02-23 02:17:37.000000', NULL, 0),
