(2176912, 295460, 42125, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on a great shot.<br/>In my opinion it is wrong to say that this picture is horrible though it shows a horrible thing, women being tortured. That is what we do, we take pictures showing everything we want. We do not imply that we care or don''t care about what we see. We just picture it. That is all art is about. Picture that?<br/>You just should have cut the text out, unless you did want this to be DQed. And this woman has a beutiful body. Probably not possible to take a bad picture of her :-)<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by KiwiPix:</b></div><hr/><i> What is the virtue here? This is a horrible image and a bad title </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Congratulation on a great shot.In my opinion it is wrong to say that this picture is horrible though it shows a horrible thing, women being tortured. That is what we do, we take pictures showing everything we want. We do not imply that we care or don''t care about what we see. We just picture it. That is all art is about. Picture that?You just should have cut the text out, unless you did want this to be DQed. And this woman has a beutiful body. Probably not possible to take a bad picture of her :-)Originally posted by KiwiPix: What is the virtue here? This is a horrible image and a bad title ', '2006-02-23 19:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2178270, 293215, 9581, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, wow I guess my dad was right they are about snowed in.. <br/>I like the contrast of the black and white here. Its a well balanced shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, wow I guess my dad was right they are about snowed in.. I like the contrast of the black and white here. Its a well balanced shot.', '2006-02-24 01:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
