(2522073, 295588, 59501, '<td valign="top">Oh my GOSH...I''ve got to remember this!!! I am doing a scrapbook on my family tree and I have several very old bibles. This has such emotion and is MUCH better than my stark, boring, emotionless dead-on centered photos of the bibles! WONDERFUL job!!! And the touch of sepia really makes it!</td>', 'Oh my GOSH...I''ve got to remember this!!! I am doing a scrapbook on my family tree and I have several very old bibles. This has such emotion and is MUCH better than my stark, boring, emotionless dead-on centered photos of the bibles! WONDERFUL job!!! And the touch of sepia really makes it!', '2006-06-16 08:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
