(2717468, 295460, 58281, '<td valign="top">Personally, regardless of rope, or model position, eg, even if the model was laying on her back , or sitting upright, the model is toned and beautiful, the surrounding  props and enviroment are magnificant, and to top it of, the colour is magic.</td>', 'Personally, regardless of rope, or model position, eg, even if the model was laying on her back , or sitting upright, the model is toned and beautiful, the surrounding  props and enviroment are magnificant, and to top it of, the colour is magic.', '2006-08-11 11:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
