(4878071, 295588, 46097, '<td valign="top">Just stumbled on this, more than 2 years since it was taken, and 2 years since the last comment. Just had to tell you that it really speaks to me........wonderful emotions, of an era long since gone, and of rock solid values, devotion, real beauty. It''s a stunning photograph, so evocative and powerful in it''s ability to provoke emotions in me. I love it.</td>', 'Just stumbled on this, more than 2 years since it was taken, and 2 years since the last comment. Just had to tell you that it really speaks to me........wonderful emotions, of an era long since gone, and of rock solid values, devotion, real beauty. It''s a stunning photograph, so evocative and powerful in it''s ability to provoke emotions in me. I love it.', '2008-08-10 05:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
